### 3. BTTS_YES_CORE BL1 (BL1, btts @ 1.95-2.10)

| | n | hit% | ROI |
|---|---|---|---|
| **BASELINE** | 641 | 59.3% | +19.6% |
| E: home_shots+away_shots>=10 | 260 | 62.7% | +26.4% |
| B: home_corners>=5 & away_corners>=4 | 249 | 57.0% | +14.7% |
| A: home_shots>=5 & away_shots>=4 | 228 | 57.9% | +16.7% |

Filter E: home_shots + away_shots >= 10
- 2021: n=45, hit%=67%, ROI=+34% ✓
- 2022: n=47, hit%=68%, ROI=+36% ✓
- 2023: n=57, hit%=61%, ROI=+24% ✓
- 2024: n=75, hit%=64%, ROI=+29% ✓
- 2025: n=36, hit%=50%, ROI=+0% ✓ (barely non-negative)

ROI improves +6.8pp. All 5 years positive. n>=15 every year.

**QUALIFIES. RECOMMENDATION: ADD** `home_shots + away_shots >= 10`
to BTTS_YES_CORE BL1 in `agent_handoff_v7.py` get_pruned_live_rule().

