### 6. RPL_OVER25_BTTS (RPL, over2.5+btts combined @ 1.8-2.1)

| | n | hit% | ROI |
|---|---|---|---|
| **BASELINE** | 173 | 57.2% | +12.4% |
| B: home_shots+away_shots>=9 | 95 | 57.9% | +13.9% |
| A: home_shots>=5 | 97 | 55.7% | +9.4% |
| D: home_shots>=4.5 & away_shots>=4.0 | 74 | 56.8% | +12.0% |

No filter meaningfully improves. Best is shots>=9 at +1.5pp — marginal.
2023 loses both baseline and filtered (-5%/-33%). RPL data starts partial in 2022.

**RECOMMENDATION: NO** — marginal improvements, not structurally different.

